:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[M. Bison (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''M. Bison''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = M. Bison
|image = E 532.png
|first appearance = [[The Supreme Evil (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has slightly below average health and attack power, but has slightly above average range along with both an [[Omni Strike]] that reaches to 425 range and a [[Toxic]] attack that takes 20% of all [[Cat Units]] health. However, he has [[Multi-Hit]] which divides his Toxic attack into three parts along with immunity to [[Wave Attack]]s, [[Knockback|knockback]], [[Freeze|freeze]], [[Slow|slow]] and [[Weaken|weaken]].

==Strategy==
[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] does a good job against M. Bison, being able to knock him back repeatedly. His 425 range also means that even Crazed Bahamut Cat and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] can help with proper stalling.

